        "descriptionType": "manual",
        "toolDescription": "Returns the 200 most recent cases: who was investigated, when, the outcome (confirmed, verify, no_change), old and new company, new title, persona, score, priority, evidence, new email, CRM record, sequence status, draft opener and owner. Use it for questions like \"who changed jobs this month\" or \"which [VERIFY] cases are open\".",
